{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S05、S10、S13对情绪转折的原因交代不如Y充分，尤其少了对为什么突然不安、为什么决定享受当下、为什么又想把喜欢藏回去的解释。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句和【】高亮让我能在听音乐时迅速抓住每段的情绪核心，不必先读完一大段才能理解重点；感受部分也有比较完整的身体、光影和水面细节，部分感受还与音乐出现的时点对应，读起来有层次而不是堆词。Y的优势是因果解释更充分，人物为什么犹豫、害怕、改变说得更明白，但左侧长句和右侧密集短词同时争夺注意力，容易变成一边阅读一边筛选信息；整体而言，X更像一段连贯的音乐叙事，情绪推进也更自然。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "28645350-d3f9-446a-bc1c-9733277d0fe8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T021503066599Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:15:56.540160+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "96cc33e8d6687a4a6501a354b53eee4d3b1bb064ee0bfc5bf1cf0535668f63c4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "